[{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac1{r(r+1)}=\\frac n{n+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{r(r+1)} =\\frac Ar-\\frac B{r+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =A(r+1)-Br.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac1{r(r+1)} =\\sum_{r=1}^n\\left(\\frac1r-\\frac1{r+1}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =1-\\frac12+\\frac12-\\frac13+\\frac13-\\frac14+\\cdots+\\frac1{n-1}-\\frac1n+\\frac1n-\\frac1{n+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =1-\\frac1{n+1}=\\frac n{n+1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Use the method of differences to find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^{40}\\frac1{r(r+1)(r+2)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving your answer in exact form.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{r(r+1)(r+2)} =\\frac Ar+\\frac B{r+1}+\\frac C{r+2},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =A(r+1)(r+2)+Br(r+2)+Cr(r+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=2A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=-B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=2C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^{40}\\frac1{r(r+1)(r+2)} =\\sum_{r=1}^{40}\\left(\\frac1{2r}-\\frac1{r+1}+\\frac1{2(r+2)}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac12-\\frac12+\\frac14+\\frac1{82}-\\frac1{41}+\\frac1{84}=\\frac{215}{861}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Use the method of differences to find the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=10}^{200}\\frac1{r^2+5r+6}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving your answer in exact form.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{r^2+5r+6} =\\frac1{(r+2)(r+3)}=\\frac A{r+2}+\\frac B{r+3},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =A(r+3)+B(r+2).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=-B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{(r+2)(r+3)}=\\frac1{r+2}-\\frac1{r+3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=10}^{200}\\frac1{(r+2)(r+3)} =\\sum_{r=10}^{200}\\left(\\frac1{r+2}-\\frac1{r+3}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac1{12}-\\frac1{13}+\\frac1{13}-\\frac1{14}+\\cdots+\\frac1{202}-\\frac1{203}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac1{12}-\\frac1{203}=\\frac{191}{2436}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Use the method of differences to determine the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=5}^{55}\\frac1{(r+1)(r+2)(r+3)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving your answer in exact form.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{(r+1)(r+2)(r+3)} =\\frac A{r+1}+\\frac B{r+2}+\\frac C{r+3},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =A(r+2)(r+3)+B(r+1)(r+3)+C(r+1)(r+2).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=2A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=-B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=2C\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=5}^{55}\\frac1{(r+1)(r+2)(r+3)} =\\sum_{r=5}^{55}\\left(\\frac1{2(r+1)}-\\frac1{r+2}+\\frac1{2(r+3)}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac1{12}-\\frac17+\\frac1{14}+\\frac1{114}-\\frac1{57}+\\frac1{116}=\\frac{136}{11571}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=10}^n\\frac1{(r+3)(r+4)}=\\frac{n-a}{b(n+c)},\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers to be found.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac4{(r+3)(r+4)} =\\frac A{r+3}+\\frac B{r+4},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n4 =A(r+4)+B(r+3).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4=-B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4=4A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac4{(r+3)(r+4)}=\\frac1{r+3}-\\frac1{r+4}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=10}^n\\frac4{(r+3)(r+4)} =\\sum_{r=10}^n\\left(\\frac1{r+3}-\\frac1{r+4}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac1{13}-\\frac1{14}+\\frac1{14}-\\frac1{15}+\\cdots+\\frac1{n+3}-\\frac1{n+4}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac1{13}-\\frac1{n+4}=\\frac{n-9}{13(n+4)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Use the method of differences to prove that for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n&gt;2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=2}^n\\frac4{4r^2-4r-3}=\\frac{a(n-b)(an+b)}{cn^2-d},\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"d\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers to be found.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n4r^2-4r-3 =(2r+1)(2r-3),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac4{4r^2-4r-3} =\\frac4{(2r+1)(2r-3)}=\\frac A{2r+1}+\\frac B{2r-3},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n4 =A(2r-3)+B(2r+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4=4B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4=-4A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac4{4r^2-4r-3}=\\frac1{2r-3}-\\frac1{2r+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=2}^n\\frac4{4r^2-4r-3} =\\sum_{r=2}^n\\left(\\frac1{2r-3}-\\frac1{2r+1}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =1-\\frac15+\\frac13-\\frac17+\\frac15-\\frac19+\\cdots+\\frac1{2n-3}-\\frac1{2n+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac43-\\frac1{2n-1}-\\frac1{2n+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac43-\\frac{2n+1}{(2n-1)(2n+1)}-\\frac{2n-1}{(2n-1)(2n+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{4(4n^2-1)}{3(2n-1)(2n+1)}-\\frac{4n}{(2n-1)(2n+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{4(4n^2-3n-1)}{3(4n^2-1)}=\\frac{4(n-1)(4n+1)}{12n^2-3}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q7","number":7,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find an expression for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac2{r^2+4r+3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence determine the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^\\infty\\frac1{r^2+4r+3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nr^2+4r+3 =(r+3)(r+1),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac2{(r+3)(r+1)} =\\frac A{r+3}+\\frac B{r+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n2 =A(r+1)+B(r+3).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2=2B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2=-2A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac2{r^2+4r+3}=\\frac1{r+1}-\\frac1{r+3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac2{r^2+4r+3} =\\sum_{r=1}^n\\left(\\frac1{r+1}-\\frac1{r+3}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac12-\\frac14+\\frac13-\\frac15+\\frac14-\\frac16+\\cdots+\\frac1{n+1}-\\frac1{n+3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac12+\\frac13-\\frac1{n+2}-\\frac1{n+3}=\\frac56-\\frac1{n+2}-\\frac1{n+3}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac1{r^2+4r+3}=\\frac12\\left[\\frac56-\\frac1{n+2}-\\frac1{n+3}\\right].\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{n+2}\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{n+3}\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^\\infty\\frac1{r^2+4r+3}=\\frac5{12}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^\\infty\\frac1{(2r+1)(2r+3)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{(2r+1)(2r+3)} =\\frac A{2r+1}+\\frac B{2r+3},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =A(2r+3)+B(2r+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-\\frac32\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=-2B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=2A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{(2r+1)(2r+3)}=\\frac1{2(2r+1)}-\\frac1{2(2r+3)}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac1{(2r+1)(2r+3)} =\\sum_{r=1}^n\\left(\\frac1{2(2r+1)}-\\frac1{2(2r+3)}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac1{2\\times3}-\\frac1{2\\times5}+\\frac1{2\\times5}-\\frac1{2\\times7}+\\cdots+\\frac1{2(2n+1)}-\\frac1{2(2n+3)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac16-\\frac1{2(2n+3)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^\\infty\\frac1{(2r+1)(2r+3)}=\\frac16\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q9","number":9,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find an expression for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac3{r^2+3r}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence determine the value of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^\\infty\\frac1{r^2+3r}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac3{r^2+3r} =\\frac3{r(r+3)}=\\frac Ar+\\frac B{r+3},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n3 =A(r+3)+Br.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3=-3B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3=3A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac3{r^2+3r}=\\frac1r-\\frac1{r+3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac3{r^2+3r} =\\sum_{r=1}^n\\left(\\frac1r-\\frac1{r+3}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =1-\\frac14+\\frac12-\\frac15+\\frac13-\\frac16+\\frac14-\\frac17+\\cdots+\\frac1n-\\frac1{n+3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =1+\\frac12+\\frac13-\\frac1{n+1}-\\frac1{n+2}-\\frac1{n+3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{11}{6}-\\frac1{n+1}-\\frac1{n+2}-\\frac1{n+3}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac1{r^2+3r}=\\frac13\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac3{r^2+3r}=\\frac13\\left(\\frac{11}{6}-\\frac1{n+1}-\\frac1{n+2}-\\frac1{n+3}\\right).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{n+1}\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{n+2}\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{n+3}\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^\\infty\\frac1{r^2+3r}=\\frac{11}{18}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>Find the smallest integer <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=3}^n\\frac1{r^2-3r+2}&gt;0.45\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{r^2-3r+2} =\\frac1{(r-1)(r-2)}=\\frac A{r-1}+\\frac B{r-2},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =A(r-2)+B(r-1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=-A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{r^2-3r+2}=\\frac1{r-2}-\\frac1{r-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=3}^n\\frac1{r^2-3r+2} =\\sum_{r=3}^n\\left(\\frac1{r-2}-\\frac1{r-1}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =1-\\frac12+\\frac12-\\frac13+\\frac13-\\frac14+\\cdots+\\frac1{n-3}-\\frac1{n-2}+\\frac1{n-2}-\\frac1{n-1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =1-\\frac1{n-1}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1-\\frac1{n-1}&gt;0.45\\Rightarrow\\frac1{n-1}&lt;0.55\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Since the smallest value that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> can be is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n-1&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and so</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"1&lt;0.55(n-1)\\Rightarrow1&lt;0.55n-0.55\\Rightarrow n&gt;\\frac{1.55}{0.55}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q11","number":11,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=n}^{2n}\\frac1{(3r-2)(3r+1)}=\\frac{an+b}{(3n-2)(6n+1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are integers to be found.</p></li><li><p>Hence find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\sum_{r=n}^{2n}\\frac1{(3r-2)(3r+1)}\\right)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{(3r-2)(3r+1)} =\\frac A{3r-2}+\\frac B{3r+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =A(3r+1)+B(3r-2).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=\\frac23\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=3A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=-3B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-\\frac13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{(3r-2)(3r+1)}=\\frac1{3(3r-2)}-\\frac1{3(3r+1)}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=n}^{2n}\\frac1{(3r-2)(3r+1)} =\\sum_{r=n}^{2n}\\left(\\frac1{3(3r-2)}-\\frac1{3(3r+1)}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac1{3(3n-2)}-\\frac1{3(3n+1)}+\\frac1{3(3n+1)}-\\frac1{3(3n+4)}+\\cdots\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\quad+\\frac1{3(6n-2)}-\\frac1{3(6n+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac1{3(3n-2)}-\\frac1{3(6n+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{(6n+1)-(3n-2)}{3(3n-2)(6n+1)}=\\frac{n+1}{(3n-2)(6n+1)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\sum_{r=n}^{2n}\\frac1{(3r-2)(3r+1)}\\right) =\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac{n+1}{(3n-2)(6n+1)}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac{n+1}{18n^2-9n-2}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\left(\\frac{1/n+1/n^2}{18-9/n-2/n^2}\\right)=0.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>A company is managing a reservoir with a total capacity of 5 million litres of water. To regulate water usage, the company models the amount of water released each year as follows:</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"W=\\frac{15}{r^2+6r+8},\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"W\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the amount of water, in millions of litres, released in year <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> represents year one.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that the total amount of water released in the first <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> years is given by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{an^2+bn}{c(n+3)(n+4)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants to be found.</p></li><li><p>Explain why, according to this model, the reservoir will never run out of water.</p></li><li><p>The company decides to release an additional fixed amount of water each year to ensure that the entire 5 million litres is used up exactly after 30 years. Refine the formula for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"W\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to reflect this change.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{15}{r^2+6r+8} =\\frac{15}{(r+2)(r+4)}=\\frac A{r+2}+\\frac B{r+4},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n15 =A(r+4)+B(r+2).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"15=-2B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"15=2A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=\\frac{15}{2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-\\frac{15}{2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{15}{r^2+6r+8}=\\frac{15}{2(r+2)}-\\frac{15}{2(r+4)}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac{15}{r^2+6r+8} =\\frac{15}{2}\\sum_{r=1}^n\\left(\\frac1{r+2}-\\frac1{r+4}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{15}{2}\\left(\\frac13-\\frac15+\\frac14-\\frac16+\\cdots+\\frac1{n+2}-\\frac1{n+4}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{15}{2}\\left(\\frac13+\\frac14-\\frac1{n+3}-\\frac1{n+4}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{35}{8}-\\frac{15}{2(n+3)}-\\frac{15}{2(n+4)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{35n^2+125n}{8(n+3)(n+4)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{15}{2(n+3)}\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac{15}{2(n+4)}\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^\\infty\\frac{15}{r^2+6r+8}=\\frac{35}{8}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So that there is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4.375\" data-display=\"false\"></span> million litres of water left in the long term.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^{30}1=30\\Rightarrow\\frac{35}{8}\\times\\sum_{r=1}^{30}\\frac{1}{30}=\\frac{35}{8}\\Rightarrow\\sum_{r=1}^{30}\\frac7{48}=\\frac{35}{8}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\quad\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac{15}{r^2+6r+8}-\\sum_{r=1}^{30}\\frac7{48}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>A government agency releases funding to startup businesses over time. The amount released in month <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\" data-display=\"false\"></span> measured in millions of pounds (£) is given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A_r=\\frac{300}{(r+1)(r+4)},\\quad r=1,2,3,\\ldots,\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A_r\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is the amount of funding released in month <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that the total amount of funding released in the first <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> months can be written in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle A=\\frac{25n(an^2+bn+c)}{3(n+2)(n+3)(n+4)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are constants to be found.</p></li><li><p>Explain why, according to this model, the government agency expects not to release more than £109 million in total.</p></li><li><p>The agency claims that after 30 months, at least 90% of the total funding will have been released. Verify this claim.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac{300}{(r+1)(r+4)} =\\frac A{r+1}+\\frac B{r+4},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n300 =A(r+4)+B(r+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"300=3A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r=-4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"300=-3B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Thus <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=100\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-100\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{300}{(r+1)(r+4)}=\\frac{100}{r+1}-\\frac{100}{r+4}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^n\\frac{300}{(r+1)(r+4)} =100\\sum_{r=1}^n\\left(\\frac1{r+1}-\\frac1{r+4}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =100\\left(\\frac12-\\frac15+\\frac13-\\frac16+\\frac14-\\frac17+\\cdots+\\frac1{n+1}-\\frac1{n+4}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =100\\left(\\frac12+\\frac13+\\frac14-\\frac1{n+2}-\\frac1{n+3}-\\frac1{n+4}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =100\\left(\\frac{13}{12}-\\frac1{n+2}-\\frac1{n+3}-\\frac1{n+4}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{25n(13n^2+81n+122)}{3(n+2)(n+3)(n+4)}.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>As <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\to\\infty\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{n+2}\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{n+3}\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{n+4}\\to0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^\\infty\\frac{300}{(r+1)(r+4)}=100\\times\\frac{13}{12}=\\frac{325}{3}=108.3\\ldots\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So the sum in the long term will never exceed the £109 million as claimed.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"A_\\infty=100\\times\\frac{13}{12}=\\frac{325}{3}\\text{ million}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=30\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"100\\left[\\frac{13}{12}-\\frac1{32}-\\frac1{33}-\\frac1{34}\\right]=\\frac{445375}{4488}=99.2\\text{ million}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{445375/4488}{325/3}\\times100=91.6\\%&gt;90\\%.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>The claim is verified that at least 90% of the total funding has been released.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q14","number":14,"question":"<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle C_r=\\frac{\\sin1}{\\cos r\\cos(r+1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive integer.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>By considering <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sin r\\cos(r+1)-\\cos r\\sin(r+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"C_r=\\tan(r+1)-\\tan r\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence evaluate <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^n C_r\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sin(A-B)=\\sin A\\cos B-\\cos A\\sin B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sin r\\cos(r+1)-\\cos r\\sin(r+1)=\\sin(r-(r+1))=\\sin(-1).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nC_r =\\frac{\\sin1}{\\cos r\\cos(r+1)}=-\\frac{\\sin r\\cos(r+1)-\\cos r\\sin(r+1)}{\\cos r\\cos(r+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\frac{\\sin r\\cos(r+1)}{\\cos r\\cos(r+1)}+\\frac{\\cos r\\sin(r+1)}{\\cos r\\cos(r+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\tan r+\\tan(r+1)=\\tan(r+1)-\\tan r,\\quad\\text{as req.}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"C_r=\\frac{\\sin(-1)}{\\cos r\\sin(r+1)}=\\tan(r+1)-\\tan r.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^n C_r =\\sum_{r=1}^n(\\tan(r+1)-\\tan r)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\tan2-\\tan1+\\tan3-\\tan2+\\tan4-\\tan3+\\cdots\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\quad+\\tan n-\\tan(n-1)+\\tan(n+1)-\\tan n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\tan(n+1)-\\tan1.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q15","number":15,"question":"<p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle D_r=\\frac{\\sinh1}{\\sinh(r)\\sinh(r+1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a positive integer.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>By considering <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh(r+1)\\cosh r-\\cosh(r+1)\\sinh r\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"D_r=\\coth r-\\coth(r+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Hence evaluate <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{k=1}^n D_r\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\sinh(A-B)=\\sinh A\\cosh B-\\cosh A\\sinh B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sinh(r+1)\\cosh r-\\cosh(r+1)\\sinh r=\\sinh1.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Therefore</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nD_r =\\frac{\\sinh1}{\\sinh(r)\\sinh(r+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{\\sinh(r+1)\\cosh r-\\cosh(r+1)\\sinh r}{\\sinh(r)\\sinh(r+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{\\sinh(r+1)\\cosh r}{\\sinh(r)\\sinh(r+1)}-\\frac{\\cosh(r+1)\\sinh r}{\\sinh(r)\\sinh(r+1)}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\coth r-\\coth(r+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"D_r=\\frac{\\sinh1}{\\sinh(r)\\sinh(r+1)}=\\coth r-\\coth(r+1).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^n D_r =\\sum_{r=1}^n(\\coth r-\\coth(r+1))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\coth1-\\coth2+\\coth2-\\coth3+\\coth3-\\coth4+\\cdots\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\quad+\\coth(n-1)-\\coth n+\\coth n-\\coth(n+1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\coth1-\\coth(n+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q16","number":16,"question":"<ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Use <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\tan(A-B)=\\displaystyle\\frac{\\tan A-\\tan B}{1+\\tan A\\tan B}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=(r+1)x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=rx\" data-display=\"false\"></span> to show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\tan(rx)\\tan((r+1)x)=\\frac{\\tan((r+1)x)}{\\tan x}-\\frac{\\tan(rx)}{\\tan x}-1.\" data-display=\"true\"></span></li><li><p>Hence show that</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\tan\\frac{2\\pi}{20}\\tan\\frac{3\\pi}{20}+\\tan\\frac{3\\pi}{20}\\tan\\frac{4\\pi}{20}+\\cdots+\\tan\\frac{14\\pi}{20}\\tan\\frac{15\\pi}{20}=\\frac{\\tan\\frac{15\\pi}{20}}{\\tan\\frac{\\pi}{20}}-15.\" data-display=\"true\"></span></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\tan((r+1)x-rx)=\\tan x\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>and</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\tan((r+1)x-rx)=\\frac{\\tan((r+1)x)-\\tan(rx)}{1+\\tan((r+1)x)\\tan(rx)}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\tan x =\\frac{\\tan((r+1)x)-\\tan(rx)}{1+\\tan((r+1)x)\\tan(rx)},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1+\\tan((r+1)x)\\tan(rx) =\\frac{\\tan((r+1)x)-\\tan(rx)}{\\tan x},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\tan((r+1)x)\\tan(rx) =\\frac{\\tan((r+1)x)}{\\tan x}-\\frac{\\tan(rx)}{\\tan x}-1,\\quad\\text{as req.}\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Let <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=\\frac\\pi{20}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so that</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\tan\\frac\\pi{20}\\tan\\frac{2\\pi}{20}+\\tan\\frac{2\\pi}{20}\\tan\\frac{3\\pi}{20}+\\cdots+\\tan\\frac{14\\pi}{20}\\tan\\frac{15\\pi}{20}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\sum_{r=1}^{14}\\tan\\left(\\frac\\pi{20}r\\right)\\tan\\left((r+1)\\frac\\pi{20}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\sum_{r=1}^{14}\\left(\\frac{\\tan((r+1)\\pi/20)}{\\tan(\\pi/20)}-\\frac{\\tan(r\\pi/20)}{\\tan(\\pi/20)}-1\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{\\tan(2\\pi/20)}{\\tan(\\pi/20)}-\\frac{\\tan(\\pi/20)}{\\tan(\\pi/20)}-1+\\frac{\\tan(3\\pi/20)}{\\tan(\\pi/20)}-\\frac{\\tan(2\\pi/20)}{\\tan(\\pi/20)}-1+\\cdots\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n \\quad+\\frac{\\tan(15\\pi/20)}{\\tan(\\pi/20)}-\\frac{\\tan(14\\pi/20)}{\\tan(\\pi/20)}-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\frac{\\tan(\\pi/20)}{\\tan(\\pi/20)}+\\frac{\\tan(15\\pi/20)}{\\tan(\\pi/20)}-14\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\frac{\\tan(15\\pi/20)}{\\tan(\\pi/20)}-15.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q17","number":17,"question":"<p>A sequence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_r\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is defined by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_r=\\ln(r+1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\\geq1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{r+1}-u_r=\\ln(1+\\frac1{r+1})\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle u_{r+1}-u_r=\\int_{r+1}^{r+2}\\frac1x\\,dx\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and hence, using the Mean Value Theorem for integrals, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac1{r+2}&lt;u_{r+1}-u_r&lt;\\frac1{r+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Using method of differences, show that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n(u_{r+1}-u_r)=\\ln(n+2)-\\ln2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nu_{r+1}-u_r =\\ln(r+2)-\\ln(r+1)=\\ln\\left(\\frac{r+2}{r+1}\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left(\\frac{r+1+1}{r+1}\\right)=\\ln\\left(1+\\frac1{r+1}\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>The mean value theorem says that if <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"f\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is continuous on <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"[a,b]\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then there exists <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\\in(a,b)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int_a^b f(x)\\,dx=f(c)(b-a).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\int_{r+1}^{r+2}\\frac1x\\,dx =[\\ln x]_{r+1}^{r+2}=\\ln(r+2)-\\ln(r+1).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>By the mean value theorem, there exists a <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\\in(r+1,r+2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> such that</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\int_{r+1}^{r+2}\\frac1x\\,dx=\\frac1c((r+2)-(r+1))=\\frac1c.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{r+1}-u_r=\\frac1c\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"c\\in(r+1,r+2)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r+1&lt;c&lt;r+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, then</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac1{r+2}&lt;\\frac1c&lt;\\frac1{r+1}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Therefore <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{r+2}&lt;u_{r+1}-u_r&lt;\\frac1{r+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, as req.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^n(u_{r+1}-u_r) =u_2-u_1+u_3-u_2+u_4-u_3+\\cdots+u_n-u_{n-1}+u_{n+1}-u_n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =u_{n+1}-u_1=\\ln(n+1+1)-\\ln(1+1)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln(n+2)-\\ln2.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.11-q18","number":18,"question":"<p>A sequence is defined by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_r=y(r)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y(x)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> satisfies the differential equation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac1{x(x+1)}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x&gt;0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the general solution to the differential equation.</p></li><li><p>Hence find an expression for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{r+1}-u_r\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Use the method of differences to evaluate <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^n(u_{r+1}-u_r)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, giving your answer as a single term.</p></li><li><p>Hence, find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\sum_{r=1}^\\infty(u_{r+1}-u_r)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\frac1{x(x+1)} =\\frac Ax+\\frac B{x+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n1 =A(x+1)+Bx.\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>; when <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"1=-B\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Hence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"A=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"B=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac1{x(x+1)}=\\frac1x-\\frac1{x+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"y=\\int\\left(\\frac1x-\\frac1{x+1}\\right)dx=\\ln x-\\ln(x+1)+c=\\ln\\left(\\frac{x}{x+1}\\right)+c.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\nu_{r+1}-u_r =\\ln\\left(\\frac{r+1}{r+2}\\right)-\\ln\\left(\\frac r{r+1}\\right).\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\text{Alternatively: }u_{r+1}-u_r =(\\ln(r+1)-\\ln(r+2)+c)-(\\ln r-\\ln(r+1)+c)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\ln r+2\\ln(r+1)-\\ln(r+2).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^n(u_{r+1}-u_r) =\\sum_{r=1}^n\\left(\\ln\\left(\\frac{r+1}{r+2}\\right)-\\ln\\left(\\frac r{r+1}\\right)\\right)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\frac23-\\ln\\frac12+\\ln\\frac34-\\ln\\frac23+\\ln\\frac45-\\ln\\frac34+\\cdots+\\ln\\frac{n+1}{n+2}-\\ln\\frac n{n+1}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln\\left(\\frac{n+1}{n+2}\\right)-\\ln\\left(\\frac12\\right)=\\ln\\left(\\frac{2(n+1)}{n+2}\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Alternatively,</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n\\sum_{r=1}^n(u_{r+1}-u_r) =\\sum_{r=1}^n(-\\ln r+2\\ln(r+1)-\\ln(r+2))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =-\\ln1+2\\ln2-\\ln2-\\ln(n+1)+2\\ln(n+1)-\\ln(n+2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n =\\ln2+\\ln(n+1)-\\ln(n+2)=\\ln\\left(\\frac{2(n+1)}{n+2}\\right).\n\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\sum_{r=1}^\\infty(u_{r+1}-u_r)=\\lim_{n\\to\\infty}\\ln\\left(\\frac{2(n+1)}{n+2}\\right)=\\ln2.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]}]